        "mode": "tldr",
        "content": "As of May 5, 2026 (run `20260505_220625`), NKE remains in a confirmed downtrend but ADX has dropped from 27.57 to 23.96 \u2014 now below the 25 threshold, weakening the trend signal. EMA cascade is fully bearish on both daily and hourly. Price $43.09 is below every EMA from 10 through 200. RSI-7 at 18.35 is deeply oversold \u2014 wiki veto on shorting here is confirmed; the Apr 14 loss (-$35.70) was triggered by an identical RSI extreme. MACD histogram has turned slightly positive (+0.3007), signaling downside momentum deceleration. Wait for bounce to 10/21 EMA zone ($44.55\u2013$45.74) for the clean short entry.\n\n---",
